# Errors per minute

Chromeless by contract: no axes, no legend, no tooltip, and no hit regions to
hover. The shape sits beside a number some other element already states, and
every point — both band bounds included — is still in the table view, because
removing the ruler is not permission to remove the numbers.

```mdv sparkline
title: Errors per minute, last 20 minutes
y: errors
band: {lower: low, upper: high}
curve: monotone
points: extremes
height: 48
format: table
---
errors | low | high
